# Dependencies, build output, caches, logs and runtime files for both apps
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.output/
**/.vite/
**/.vinxi/
**/.tanstack/
**/.nitro/
**/.wrangler/
**/bootstrap/cache/*.php
**/storage/framework/cache/**
**/storage/framework/sessions/**
